Title: AI-Powered Fake News Detector Browser Extension
Author: Kutay Sunguroglu
Description: A browser extension that helps users identify fake or misleading information on social media platforms. When a user clicks the "Analyze" button on a post, the extension uses artificial intelligence to examine the content, check its sources, and compare its claims with reliable information from trusted websites.
        
        Based on the analysis, the extension provides a trust score from 0 to 10, where 0 indicates highly unreliable information and 10 indicates highly trustworthy information.
        
        The extension also provides a short explanation of the score and links to supporting sources, helping users decide whether the information is credible before sharing it.
